010:     Each MLP prediction runs under a BudgetContext. If the FLOP budget,
011:     wall-time limit, or residual wall-time limit is exceeded, predictions are
012:     zeroed and the violation is recorded. Score per MLP = final_layer_mse *
013:     max(0.1, C_m / B_m) for valid runs, where C_m = F_m + lambda * R_m. For
014:     failure-flagged runs (FLOP/time/residual budget exhausted), the multiplier
015:     is forced to 1.0. The aggregate adjusted_final_layer_score is the arithmetic
016:     mean of per-MLP scores. Lower is better.
